# 1Password service account per project (see modules/op/op in the dotfiles repo).
# Copy to ~/.config/op-services; never link it or commit the real one.
#
# One mapping per line: <project directory>,<Keychain item>
# Inside a mapped directory (longest match wins), op reads the token from that item.
# A malformed line, or a directory that doesn't exist, makes op fail.
#
# This only keeps a project from using the wrong account by mistake. Any program
# running as you can set OP_KEYCHAIN_SERVICE or read any item with security, so
# it doesn't isolate projects from each other.
#
# ~/dev/project,op-project
